      },
      {
        "text": "The mixed-SAM approach yields PCEs of 24.48%, 25.65%, and 22.60% for triple cation PSCs.",
        "anchor": "The improved buried interface quality leads to power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 24.48%, 25.65%, and 22.60% for triple cation PSCs with bandgaps of 1.61, 1.58, and 1.68 eV, respectively, demonstrating the wide applicability of this approach.",
        "evidence_type": "measurement"
      },
      {
        "text": "The PSCs retain 84% of initial PCE after 1200 h at 85 °C.",
